1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,681
This is the WenQuest digital factory:

2
00:00:02,701 --> 00:00:06,250
a teaching industrial park with four plants, gearbox, robot,

3
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:10,235
circuit board and chip test and packaging, each supplying the next.

4
00:00:11,255 --> 00:00:13,835
The gearbox plant builds a two-stage reducer.

5
00:00:14,555 --> 00:00:17,065
An order comes in, ERP schedules it, MRP plans materials,

6
00:00:17,085 --> 00:00:19,728
and the shop floor reports progress, all on one data thread.

7
00:00:20,748 --> 00:00:23,885
The robot plant builds cobots, AGVs and a wheeled humanoid.

8
00:00:24,605 --> 00:00:28,213
It buys reducers from the gearbox plant and drive boards from the circuit

9
00:00:28,233 --> 00:00:28,809
board plant.

10
00:00:29,529 --> 00:00:31,515
A joint test bench measures backlash,

11
00:00:31,535 --> 00:00:34,010
and robots keep reporting back after shipping.

12
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:38,821
The circuit board plant runs an SMT line and a dozen back-end machines,

13
00:00:38,841 --> 00:00:41,601
building joint drive boards and AGV controllers,

14
00:00:42,321 --> 00:00:45,685
each tested item by item on a functional test bench.

15
00:00:46,405 --> 00:00:51,271
The chip plant tests, packages and final-tests our own encoder interface chip.

16
00:00:51,991 --> 00:00:54,819
Every square on the wafer map is one die's result,

17
00:00:54,839 --> 00:00:57,440
and the B revision of the drive board uses it.

18
00:00:58,160 --> 00:01:01,009
Quality issues come with control charts and 8D,

19
00:01:01,029 --> 00:01:04,794
traced from one machine to a batch, even to one torque wrench.

20
00:01:05,514 --> 00:01:08,443
The command center shows the whole plant: it spots problems,

21
00:01:08,463 --> 00:01:10,262
traces causes and simulates outcomes.

22
00:01:10,981 --> 00:01:12,968
The AI alerts; people decide.

23
00:01:13,688 --> 00:01:17,942
Students work through more than twenty labs here, from order to delivery,

24
00:01:17,962 --> 00:01:20,284
root cause, calibration and after-sales,

25
00:01:20,754 --> 00:01:22,249
much like a real job.

26
00:01:23,269 --> 00:01:24,948
Enter the digital factory,

27
00:01:25,118 --> 00:01:28,263
or start with the factory demo, no sign-in needed.
